Pure modules from the upstream project are vendored under src/upstream:
- diskSpace.ts: original filesystem/APFS deduplication; generalized structural
  input types preserve extra Harness fields without importing VS Code types.
- rawDataAdapter.ts and rawDataTypes.ts: original Go response adapter and types;
  the snapshot type import points at the extracted local snapshot.ts.
- snapshot.ts: snapshot types extracted from the original src/systemData.ts,
  with the GpuCard type inlined; no VS Code lifecycle code is included.
- prometheusParser.ts: original src/mactop-backend/prometheusParser.ts parser.

The Harness lifecycle, worker service, authenticated RPC route, React dashboard,
preferences, Agent integration, packaging, documentation and tests are new in
this adaptation. Native backends are opt-in and externally managed.

systeminformation is distributed as an external npm dependency under its own
MIT license. DeepSeek Harness runtime packages retain their own licenses.
Native mactop/Go executables are not included in this package.
